<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">map</ansi> (skill)

The <ansi fg="skill">map</ansi> command displays a map of the area,
centered on your character.

Not everything is guaranteed to be shown on the map.
Hidden areas and secret passages may remain concealed.

As your mapping skill improves, you can see farther and
reveal more of your surroundings. Higher Perception also
expands what you can discern on the map.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="skill">map</ansi>        Display a map of the nearby area.
  <ansi fg="skill">map wide</ansi>   Display a zoomed-out overview
                 (requires advanced mapping skill).

<ansi fg="yellow">Related: </ansi>
  <ansi fg="command">help map-examples</ansi>
  <ansi fg="command">help perception</ansi>

